  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.header": "How to build a gregtech multiblock",
  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.text_1": "First, you need a neutron activator main block.",
  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.text_2": "One click placement using the terminal.",
  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.text_3": "Place a machine control cover plate in the direction facing redstone at the neutron accelerator.",
  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.text_4": "Connecting to the power grid.",
  "kubejs.ponder.neutron_activator_building.text_5": "Set the maximum kinetic energy of the neutron sensor to the maximum kinetic energy required by the formula, and the minimum kinetic energy to the minimum kinetic energy required by the formula+5MeV (1MeV\u003d1000Kev).",
