  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.header": "How to build a gregtech multiblock",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_1": "First, you need a windmill control center main block",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_2": "One click placement using the terminal.",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_3": "Place the input hatch to ensure that lubricating oil can be input",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_4": "Place sufficient kinetic output hatch to ensure that stress can be output.",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_5": "Place windmill bearings within the 16 grid radius of the main block, and the more they are placed, the more stress they will output. A maximum of 16 windmill bearings can be included.",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_6": "Connect 128 sails or wool to each windmill bearing to maximize the stress of each windmill bearing.",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_7": "Activate the windmill bearings.",
  "kubejs.ponder.windmill_control_center_building.text_8": "With sufficient stress output compartment, you can now enjoy the power of the windmill."
}